        },
        {
          "text": "Balamu abonye yuk’ Uhoraho akunda guhezagira Abisirayeli, ntiyagenda nk’ubga mbere kurondera ubumenyi, ariko yerekeza amaso yiwe mu bugaragwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
